rdana\">영혼대화(Spirit \n                            Speaking)</font></a></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;l \n                            </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_ev/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">지능평가(Eval. Int)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> l </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_resist/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">마법저항(Resist Spells)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/ball.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                            팔라딘(Paladin)&amp;네크로멘서마법(Necromancer)&amp;닌자(Ninja)&amp;무사도(Busido)</b></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_pal/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">팔라딘상세정보</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;l \n                            </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_necro/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">네크마법상세정보</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_ninja/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">닌자상세정보</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_busido/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">무사도상세정보</font></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\